I just learned the wiz is no wimp.  It was the first time I've seen him in
many and many a version.  He used to be easy.  Now I'm playing the distributed
binaries of 3.0j and he isn't.

I waltzed through the castle, and thought that meant I had a reasonable chance
with the Wiz.  Maybe somebody can tell me what I needed to be or do

Playing Valkyrie.
I was invisible and had tp control and resistance to most things except magic.
I never saw a polymorph wand.  Got my wishes in the castle, but may have
misused them.  
Normal stats except I'd been eating a lot of giants for 18/57.
Hadn't prayed in a long time; all my offerings made me feel inadequate, so I
didn't dare.  Thus I had only +8 Excalibur.  Hanging around the altar never
seemed useful: I was in danger of starving.
I also had:
  AC = -17
  X Level 13
  speed boots
  uncursed amulet of reflection (neat!)
  a helm of brilliance (but my spells still failed most of the time)
  a blessed luckstone and had thrown lots of gems
  levitation boots
  ring of polymorph control
and a bunch of other stuff that didn't seem important.

Well, the Wiz would just visit me and disappear; my beating on him seemed
futile.  He made my armor go away then trashed me.

Any suggestions?
